 n 250 unique hikes\, bikes\, paddles\, events and more\, Walktober is full
  of adventures for all ages! Walktober is a celebration of one of the nati
 on's oldest National Heritage Corridors\, right here in Connecticut\, in o
 ur most colorful season. We have an online guide to help you choose your a
 dventures and a printed guide too. Just give us a call or an email and we 
