UID:3873394b3cfc6441b811f09b8d57@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Haunt on Eden was born from one simple passion: creating unfor
 gettable scares. If Halloween is your favorite time of year because of the
  blood\, screams\, and heart-pounding terror\, then you've found your kind
  of place. What began in 2013 as a modest 20' x 30' backyard haunt at the 
 home of Jeff and Susan Donis has grown into one of Connecticut's premier h
 aunted attractions. After five years of expanding far beyond what their ba
 ckyard could hold\, Haunt on Eden found its permanent home at Mount Southi
 ngton Ski Area\, where it has thrilled guests every fall since 2018.\n\nSo
 urce: https://ctvisit.com/events/haunt-eden-1
